iture for the Research Programs during the last three financial \nyears is at Annexure-I. \n \n(d) & (e):   There have been (9) complaints against officials in AICTE.  These complaints are \nentrusted for examination by a committee head ed by retired Justice of High Court. The \nState-wise list of the complaints against AICTE and action taken thereon is at annexure-II. \n***** \n \n \n\n \nAnnexure as referred to in reply to  Part ( c ) of the Lok Sabha Unstarre\nFunctioning of AICTE\n   2013-14 \nSTATE \n Scheme \nResearch Promotion \nScheme \nResearch Park Quality Improvement \nProgramme \nInnovation Pro\nScheme\nFund \nAllocation  \nExpenditur\ne  \nFund \nAllocatio\nn  \nExpenditur\ne  \nFund \nAllocatio\nn  \nExpenditur\ne  \nFund \nAllocatio\nn  \nExp\nAndhra \nPradesh   24007541   0   2425215\nArunachal \nP r a d e h    0  0  0  \nAssam   7900001   0   0   \nB i h a r    0  0  0  \nChandigarh   0   0   3678842   \nChhatisgarh   4428510   0       \nDelhi   3159844   0 9472436\nGoa  1985824 0   \nGujrat  8430374 0 300000\nHaryana   8772746   0   0   \nHimachal \nPradesh   1633334   0   0   \nJammu & \nKashmir   1243334   0   0   \nJharkhand   582353   0 2448484\nKarnataka   19033630   0   14171941   \nKerala   2140000   0   777000   \nMadhya \nPradesh   6820589   0   0\nMaharashtra   37313047   0   24556150   \n\nM a n i p u r    0  0  0  \nMeghalaya  0 0 0\nM i z o r a m   000\nNagaland  0 0 0\nOdisha   4551667   0   1840887   \nPondicherry   0   0   2314500   \nPunjab   7131804   0   1799000   \nRajasthan   2290001   0   0   \nS k k i m    0  0  0  \nTamilnadu   22029205   0   29376783   \nUttar Pradesh   2012549   0   13116246   \nUttarakhand   0   0   13779633   \nWest Bengal   1667668   0   11508840   \nTotal 500000000 167134021 80000000 0 60000000 131565957 10000000\n \n\nANNEXURE –II \nANNEXURE AS REFERRED TO IN REPLY TO PART (e) OF THE LOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 172 FOR REPLY ON 18.07.2016 ASKED BY  SHRI SANJAY \nDHOTRE, SHRI BHARTUHARI MAHTAB A